rk location, collect five bark if available, and continue locating vines after recovery.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The learned method makes material, labor and protection limitations explicit; no shelter benefit has yet been observed.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Staying alive without reckless experiments; learning practical skills through evidence; making a welcoming, useful place to rest with others.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{\\\"lin\\\":\\\"A potential building partner; I want to coordinate supplies openly and avoid competing for scarce materials.\\\"}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

